{"id": "17-3359-2-12", "zh": "同样，促使正在希求的人：icchāpeti、icchāpayati、eseti、esayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3359-13-18", "zh": "促使正在约束的人：niyāmeti、niyāmayati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3359-19-28", "zh": "促使正在坐着的人：āseti、āsayati、acchāpeti、acchāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3359-29-34", "zh": "促使正在获得的人：lābheti、lābhayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3359-35-44", "zh": "促使正在说话的人：vāceti、vācayati、vācāpeti、vācāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3359-45-53", "zh": "同样有 vāseti、vāsayati、vāsāpeti、vāsāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3359-54-61", "zh": "vāheti、vāhayati、vāhāpeti、vāhāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3359-62-69", "zh": "jīreti、jīrayati、jīrāpeti、jīrāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3359-70-77", "zh": "māreti、mārayati、mārāpeti、mārāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3359-78-82", "zh": "dasseti、dassayati 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3360-2-12", "zh": "同样，促使正在刺的人：todeti、todayati、todāpeti、todāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3360-13-26", "zh": "促使正在进入的人，或者促使他进入：paveseti、pavesayati、pavesāpeti、pavesāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3360-27-32", "zh": "促使正在指示的人：uddisāpeti、uddisāpayati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3360-33-38", "zh": "促使有能力的人：pahāveti、pahāvayati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3360-39-48", "zh": "促使正在躺卧的人：sāyeti、sāyayati、sāyāpeti、sāyāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3360-49-70", "zh": "这里 e 音被替换为 āya，得到 sayāpeti、sayāpayati；依照“kvaci dhātū”等规则，在 ṇāpe、ṇāpaya 之前，替换而来的 āya 变为短音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3360-71-76", "zh": "促使正在引导的人：nayāpeti、nayāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3360-77-85", "zh": "促使正在站立的人：patiṭṭhāpeti、patiṭṭhāpayati，或者 patiṭṭhapeti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3361-2-7", "zh": "在“促使正在杀的人”这个意义上，加上 ṇe、ṇaya 等词缀。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3362-2-9", "zh": "“ṇamhi”（当带 ṇ 的词缀在后时）一语承接上文。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3363-2-7", "zh": "544. hana 替换为 ghāta。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3364-2-12", "zh": "当带 ṇ 的使役词缀在后时，hana 这个词根替换为 ghāta。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3364-13-34", "zh": "ghāteti、ghātayati、ghātāpeti、ghātāpayati；依照“vadho vā sabbatthā”规则替换为 vadha 时，得到 vadheti、vadhāpeti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3365-2-7", "zh": "促使正在献供的人：juhāveti、juhāvayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3365-8-17", "zh": "促使正在舍弃的人：jahāpeti、jahāpayati、hāpeti、hāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3365-18-23", "zh": "促使正在给予的人：dāpeti、dāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3365-24-33", "zh": "促使正在关闭的人：pidhāpeti、pidhāpayati、pidahāpeti、pidahāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3366-2-11", "zh": "促使正在阻挡的人：rodheti、rodhayati、rodhāpeti、rodhāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3366-12-21", "zh": "促使正在切断的人：chedeti、chedayati、chedāpeti、chedāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3366-22-32", "zh": "促使正在联结的人：yojeti、yojayati、yojāpeti、yojāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3366-33-42", "zh": "促使正在吃的人：bhojeti、bhojayati、bhojāpeti、bhojāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3366-43-52", "zh": "促使正在释放的人：moceti、mocayati、mocāpeti、mocāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3367-2-7", "zh": "促使正在嬉戏的人：deveti、devayati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3367-8-13", "zh": "促使正在生起的事物：uppādeti、uppādayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3367-14-19", "zh": "促使正在觉悟的人：bodheti、bodhayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3367-20-34", "zh": "依照“dādhāntato yo kvacī”规则插入 y 音，得到 bujjhāpeti、bujjhāpayati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3367-35-44", "zh": "促使正在欢喜的人：toseti、tosayati、tosāpeti、tosāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3367-45-54", "zh": "促使正在平息的人：sameti、samayati；因为属于 ghaṭ 等词根，所以不作增音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3367-55-60", "zh": "促使正在发怒的人：kopeti、kopayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3367-61-70", "zh": "促使正在出生的事物：janeti、janayati；因为属于 ghaṭ 等词根，所以不作增音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3368-2-8", "zh": "促使正在听的人听法：sāveti、sāvayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3368-9-14", "zh": "促使正在到达的人：pāpeti、pāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3369-2-7", "zh": "促使正在出售的人：vikkāyāpeti、vikkāyāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3369-8-13", "zh": "促使正在取胜的人：jayāpeti、jayāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3369-14-19", "zh": "促使正在了知的人：ñāpeti、ñāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3369-20-33", "zh": "促使正在拿取的人：gāheti、gāhayati、gāhāpeti、gāhāpayati、gaṇhāpeti、gaṇhāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3370-2-7", "zh": "促使正在铺展的人：vitāneti、vitānayati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3370-8-35", "zh": "某人在做事，另一个人对他这样说：“做吧，做吧。”这就是促使正在做的人，或者促使他去做：kāreti、kārayati、kārāpeti、kārāpayati 等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3371-2-7", "zh": "促使正在偷盗的人：corāpeti、corāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3371-8-21", "zh": "促使正在思考的人：cintāpeti、cintāpayati；促使正在供养的人：pūjāpeti、pūjāpayati 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3371-22-24", "zh": "各处都容易理解。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3372-2-7", "zh": "在以词根词缀结尾的词之后，也可以加使役词缀；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-3373-2-7", "zh": "带使役词缀的词加上 yu、ṇvu 的用例，在这里就是证明。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "17-3374-2-8", "zh": "因此，促使正在忍耐的人：titikkheti、titikkhāpeti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3374-9-18", "zh": "促使正在治疗的人：tikiccheti、tikicchayati、tikicchāpeti、tikicchāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3374-19-31", "zh": "同样有 bubhukkheti、bubhukkhayati、bubhukkhāpeti、bubhukkhāpayati；促使表现得像山一样的人：pabbatāyayati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3374-32-36", "zh": "puttīyayati 等形式也同样成立。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3375-2-3", "zh": "以上是词根词缀结尾法。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3376-2-7", "zh": "为了教法，我凭自己的理解阐述了动词；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3377-2-6", "zh": "愿明智的人凭多闻的力量来思考这部分内容。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3378-2-8", "zh": "bhavati、tiṭṭhati、seti、ahosi 这一类词，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3379-2-6", "zh": "通晓宾语特征的人应当知道它们是不及物动词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3380-2-5", "zh": "不及物动词加上表示致使意义的词缀之后，也成为及物动词；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3381-2-9", "zh": "例如：比丘修习那摧毁贪等烦恼的道。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3382-2-4", "zh": "以上是《词形成就论》中的动词篇，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3383-2-3", "zh": "第六篇。", "confidence": 80}
